37
00:03:52,000 --> 00:04:00,000
Now, when the copy key activates, it can be simulated with the board at the same time and conflict with the board at the same time.

38
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:09,000
When simulating, you can adjust its position by pressing the left mouse button to drag and drop the copy key.

39
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:14,000
When dragging and dropping the copy key, you can see that the packaging material will also move along with it.

40
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:25,000
The copy keys of the package or ring type are usually smaller, and the space that the board can pass through is smaller.

41
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:32,000
Considering this situation, please reduce the size of the board.

42
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,000
Please reduce the size of the board.

43
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:43,000
The thickness of the copy key will give you a more stable simulation effect.

44
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:46,000
When simulating, you can modify the weight of the copy key.

45
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:57,000
You can go to the copy key window, find the copy key type, and then go to the attribute editor to modify it.

46
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:01,000
When you freeze the copy key, it will be frozen in the 3D window.

47
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,000
It will not be affected by weight or weight.

48
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:12,000
You may have the ability to change the position of the copy key with the help of the 3D window.

49
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:17,000
When resizing the copy key, it will not be affected by the 3D window.

50
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:26,000
When resizing the copy key, it will be free of the simulation of the 3D window.

51
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:34,000
Now, when you calculate the collision of the adhesives, the adhesives will no longer stick to the point as the standard, but will make the entire surface of the adhesives participate in the collision.

52
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:52,000
Now you can adjust the hardness of the adhesives.

53
00:05:52,000 --> 00:06:02,000
When an adhesives is activated, you can select it and then go to the attribute editor to modify its hardness.

54
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:13,000
If the adhesives are relatively soft, please reduce the hardness value, so that it will have some bending and stretching effects with the simulation.

55
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:21,000
