124
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:47,000
By adjusting the thickness of the rendering, you can increase or decrease the thickness of the side of a board.

125
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:53,000
There are three settings for the direction of squeeze, front, back, and full.

126
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:59,000
When choosing the front, the thickness of the side of the board will be squeezed forward based on the front of the board.

127
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:05,000
When choosing the full, the same as the previous version, the thickness is squeezed to the front and back of the board at the same time.

128
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:10,000
When choosing the back, the thickness of the side of the board is squeezed backwards based on the back.

129
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:16,000
