135
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:49,000
The number of sections on the side will affect the layout of the side grid.

136
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:53,000
The higher the value, the more detailed the side grid, the more natural the transition will be.

137
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:57,000
