138
00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:01,000
In addition to the fact that the curve value can be set high and low,

139
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:05,000
but when the number of sections on the side is low, it will not provide enough curve effect.

140
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:09,000
Eventually the side will become a cross-section with no curve.

141
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:13,000
